  "description": "KOBBIM crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group A b a 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C45 H107 Nd5 O16. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd1F (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd2F (Nd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.539-5.419 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.91-170.79°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Nd5(μ5-O)(μ3-OR)2(μ2-OR)6(OR)5(ROH)2 (R = Pri); C45H107Nd5O16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ5-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
